    {
      "id": "00426fdc-751f-57b0-8bb5-a917a1f67205",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "내일 탈 메크, 아직 좀 어색해요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "The mech I'm piloting tomorrow still feels a bit awkward.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "98267f62-bbda-591d-b60c-29a44a0c899e",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "이야기 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "00426fdc-751f-57b0-8bb5-a917a1f67205"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "a1b8c95e-c878-50ab-b9d2-905c231dc63e": "story_sat",
        "f6b842d7-4b9f-5dbd-8087-78d9330c6d16": -1,
        "3f8b7deb-2017-5480-9369-bf5c05d7aea7": 0,
        "f5c0bef3-6ad1-503c-ba80-a18e14f061c4": "",
        "cfba3f48-9127-52b3-9e6d-a6f519c777f2": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "daaab667-9f66-57ea-82dd-4e8ee2727dd8",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ecb226c5-5b81-573f-90a5-a035f72d8a1f",
          "text": "오늘 그 메크로 시뮬레이션 한 번 더 돌리자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "280a0a45-8ecd-547f-89e9-328d5d660ff6": "mastery:+8;stress:+5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "81dfc5ca-1621-56a4-96d3-98d9ef7f0a61",
          "text": "넌 잘 탈 거야. 믿고 맡길게.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "280a0a45-8ecd-547f-89e9-328d5d660ff6": "ok>trust:+3;ok>mastery:+4;ng>trust:+1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "d416cf2e-945d-54ea-a00e-d260fd108713",
          "text": "오늘은 푹 자 둬. 내일이 진짜야.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "280a0a45-8ecd-547f-89e9-328d5d660ff6": "stress:-8;trust:+1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:ecb226c5-5b81-573f-90a5-a035f72d8a1f": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Let's run one more simulation with it today.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:81dfc5ca-1621-56a4-96d3-98d9ef7f0a61": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You'll do fine. I'm trusting you with it.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:d416cf2e-945d-54ea-a00e-d260fd108713": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Sleep well tonight. Tomorrow is what counts.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "281e2adf-bc45-5c22-bfa4-773f718458ac",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 940,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네, 감 잡아 볼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Okay, I'll get the hang of it.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beae51e2-cc35-5741-b63b-921a3b0ebc23",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "믿어 주시는 만큼 해낼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I'll live up to that trust.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "3a74d316-5766-59c3-b587-3f2ba89d1acd": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a9bf5e44-0b58-5327-9b93-be2b9be876cc",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…부담되네요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "…That's a lot of pressure.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "3a74d316-5766-59c3-b587-3f2ba89d1acd": "ng"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4d0a0b66-91dc-5be3-8ab2-507ee2e092d9",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 300,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네, 일찍 잘게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Okay, I'll turn in early.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
